2. A person who conducts an act specified in any subparagraph of Article 21 (2);

3. A person who produces an embryo for any purpose other than pregnancy, in violation of Article 23 (1);

4. A person who provides or uses an embryo, egg, or sperm for money, an interest in property, or any other consideration; induces or assists another person to conduct such act; acts as a broker for conducting such act, in violation of Article 23 (3);

