(2) Any person who uses a residual embryo, in violation of Article 29 (1), shall be punished by imprisonment with labor for not more than three years or by a fine not exceeding 50 million won.

(3) Any person who attempts to commit a crime specified in paragraph (1) 1 or 2 shall also be punished.

